      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners express deep appreciation for the compassionate, courteous, and informative veterinary personnel at SNAP. Reviewers highlight front-desk staff and clinicians who treat nervous rescue animals with genuine gentleness and provide detailed post-surgery instructions, with only minor feedback regarding occasional reserved intake desk communication."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
